# hair/adult/highponytail: High ponytail: the hair swept up smooth to a ribbon at the crown; the ears clear. The tail falls from
# the crown and swings: highponytail_hang.
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21; man and woman). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair highponytail
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys rest

